om/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113023","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113023.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113023.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-22T00:42:35Z"},"body":"Currently, on Linux, profiling with Tracy will only ever have 4 frames, where the 4th frame has data for all the real frames:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1768\" height=\"265\" alt=\"Selection_402\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6dddec2a-b570-408b-bdd2-6ad8d3fa712e\" />\r\n\r\nThis is because the `GodotProfileFrameMark` is at the start of `OS_LinuxBSD::run()` which only runs once and contains the main loop.\r\n\r\nThis PR moves it inside the `while (true) { ... }` loop which is just like how it's done in `OS_Windows::run()`","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113023/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin